<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash wheat firms on export demand.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash wheat firms on export demand.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine cash wheat prices firmed on the Buenos Aires Cereals exchange with thin supply but exporters likely to need to cover major shipments in the near term, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash maize traded quietly due to the lack of imminent shipments. Soybean prices were stable though with substantial volume while sunseed prices were pushed up by crusher demand.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
